1064 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The KodaVent is flashed like a window\054 with a shingled\054 window\055grade flashing sequence that manages moisture at every layer\056 Precision injection\055molded from ASA plastic\054 the KodaVent offers exceptional UV resistance and can be painted to match your siding or trim\056 A magnetically sealed shutter keeps the opening weathertight\054 backed by an interior sloped sill that sheds water back outside\056 Integrated J\055channels hide the siding cut edges for a clean\054 finished look\056 With no screen to clog with lint or debris\054 airflow stays unobstructed\056)
